================================================================================
Regenerating this file
================================================================================

This NOTICE was authored manually for clarity. To rebuild a strict
machine-generated attribution list:

  flutter pub deps --json > /tmp/pub-deps.json
  cd functions && npm ls --all --json > /tmp/npm-deps.json

Each entry's license metadata can then be pulled from pub.dev / npmjs.com
and emitted in a NOTICE section. A `tools/build_notice.dart` generator is
filed as a follow-up improvement.
